name issue_283_longest_freeze_no_metrics
describe A 2 s outage freezes video for at least 2 s; the bench must report that freeze as the longest, on every build
# Issue #283: with metrics compiled out (the embedded preset) the bench read the
# longest freeze from a Histogram that records nothing, and reported the render
# gap at the end of the call (tens of ms) instead. This is a metric-correctness
# check: the outage alone guarantees a freeze of about its length.
# fix-record-base-cmake: -DSM_ENABLE_METRICS=OFF -DSM_ENABLE_EVENTS=OFF
compare_seeds 80
duration 20s
at 0s  capacity=2500kbps delay=30ms queue=400ms
at 10s down
at 12s up
expect video.freeze_count >= 1
expect video.longest_freeze_ms >= 1900
